<title>SWEDEN: Graninge says to sell Gullspangs shares to IVO.</title>
<headline>Graninge says to sell Gullspangs shares to IVO.</headline>
<dateline>STOCKHOLM 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Swedish forestry and power company Graninge said on Tuesday it reached agreement to sell 10.5 million shares in power group Gullspangs Kraft AB to Finland's power company Imatran Voima OY (IVO).  </p>
<p>IVO will pay in both cash and power assets, Graninge said in a statement without disclosing further details.</p>
<p>Earlier on Tuesday IVO said it would buy Sweden's state owned power company Vattenfall AB's stake in Gullspangs Kraft.</p>
<p>-- Birgitta Forsberg, Stockholm newsroom +46-8-700 1017</p>
